<title>CANADA: Algoma Steel plans share issue.</title>
<headline>Algoma Steel plans share issue.</headline>
<dateline>TORONTO 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Algoma Steel Inc said Monday it entered into an agreement with a syndicate of underwriters to offer in Canada six million to 7.5 million common shares at C$8.75 each.</p>
<p>If all 7.5 million common shares are purchased, the net proceeds to the Company will about C$62 million, it said. The proceeds will be used to support funding of a capital expenditure program and for general corporate purposes, Algoma said.</p>
<p>((Reuters Vancouver Bureau (604) 664-7314))</p>
</text>
